+        # The reviewed treatment is admitted only for the frozen 10,016-token
+        # suffix: zigzag CP8 gives exactly 1,252 local rows. Warmup and every
+        # other dynamic shape retain the stock two-call implementation.
+        if q_rows != 1_252:
